  "dialogue": {
    "lines": [
      {
        "character": "pvzce:purwhite",
        "portrait": "startled",
        "text": "雾，雾是不是越来越大了！",
        "voice": "",
        "side": "left",
        "animation": {
          "type": "shake"
        }
      },
      {
        "character": "pvzce:purwhite",
        "portrait": "panic",
        "text": "它...它会不会蔓延门口",
        "voice": "",
        "side": "left"
      },
      {
        "character": "pvzce:purwhite",
        "portrait": "panic",
        "text": "然后...然后我们就什么也看不清了！",
        "voice": "",
        "side": "left"
      },
      {
        "character": "pvzce:purwhite",
        "portrait": "panic",
        "text": "万一...万一，里面有什么奇怪的东西",
        "voice": "",
        "side": "left"
      },
      {
        "character": "pvzce:purwhite",
        "portrait": "scared",
        "text": "啊哇，咱...咱会被吓死的...",
        "voice": "",
        "side": "left",
        "animation": {
          "type": "shake"
        }
      },
      {
        "character": "pvzce:lantina",
        "portrait": "confused",
        "text": "嗯...?你们...在做什么？",
        "voice": "",
        "side": "right",
        "slots": [
          {
            "slot": "left",
            "character": "pvzce:purwhite"
          },
          {
            "slot": "right",
            "character": "pvzce:lantina"
          }
        ],
        "animation": {
          "type": "scale",
          "scale": 0.33,
          "target": "pvzce:purwhite",
          "duration": 0.7
        }
      },
      {
        "character": "pvzce:lantina",
        "portrait": "curious",
        "text": "诶？这个，好...好小一只",
        "voice": "",
        "side": "right",
        "slots": [
          {
            "slot": "left",
            "character": "pvzce:purwhite"
          },
          {
            "slot": "right",
            "character": "pvzce:lantina"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "character": "pvzce:purwhite",
        "portrait": "fierce",
        "text": "不...不要说咱小啦，咱还是很厉害的说！",
        "voice": "",
        "side": "left",
        "slots": [
          {
            "slot": "left",
            "character": "pvzce:purwhite"
          },
          {
            "slot": "right",
            "character": "pvzce:lantina"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "character": "pvzce:lantina",
        "portrait": "smile",
        "text": "嗯嗯，知道啦知道啦，你很厉害",
        "voice": "",
        "side": "right",
        "slots": [
          {
            "slot": "left",
            "character": "pvzce:purwhite"
          },
          {
            "slot": "right",
            "character": "pvzce:lantina"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "character": "pvzce:lantina",
        "portrait": "smirk",
        "text": "还是感觉好可爱",
        "voice": "",
        "side": "right",
        "slots": [
          {
            "slot": "left",
            "character": "pvzce:purwhite"
          },
          {
            "slot": "right",
            "character": "pvzce:lantina"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "character": "pvzce:purwhite",
        "portrait": "playful",
        "text": "可爱就可爱吧~嘿嘿",
        "voice": "",
        "side": "left",
        "slots": [
          {
            "slot": "left",
            "character": "pvzce:purwhite"
          },
          {
            "slot": "right",
            "character": "pvzce:lantina"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "character": "pvzce:lantina",
        "portrait": "smile",
        "text": "对啦，我叫兰提娜",
        "voice": "",
        "side": "right",
        "slots": [
          {
            "slot": "left",
            "character": "pvzce:purwhite"
          },
          {
            "slot": "right",
            "character": "pvzce:lantina"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "character": "pvzce:lantina",
        "portrait": "smile",
        "text": "兰缇娜的兰，兰提娜的提",
        "voice": "",
        "side": "right",
        "slots": [
          {
            "slot": "left",
            "character": "pvzce:purwhite"
          },
          {
            "slot": "right",
            "character": "pvzce:lantina"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "character": "pvzce:purwhite",
        "portrait": "playful",
        "text": "兰提娜的娜！",
        "voice": "",
        "side": "left",
        "slots": [
          {
            "slot": "left",
            "character": "pvzce:purwhite"
          },
          {
            "slot": "right",
            "character": "pvzce:lantina"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "character": "pvzce:lantina",
        "portrait": "embarrassed",
        "text": "诶嘿...",
        "voice": "",
        "side": "right",
        "slots": [
          {
            "slot": "left",
            "character": "pvzce:purwhite"
          },
          {
            "slot": "right",
            "character": "pvzce:lantina"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "character": "pvzce:purwhite",
        "portrait": "confused",
        "text": "我叫紫夜白，还有，话说姐姐为什也在这里呀",
        "voice": "",
        "side": "left",
        "slots": [
          {
            "slot": "left",
            "character": "pvzce:purwhite"
          },
          {
            "slot": "right",
            "character": "pvzce:lantina"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "character": "pvzce:lantina",
        "portrait": "confident",
        "text": "啊哈！我可以驱散迷雾哦",
        "voice": "",
        "side": "right",
        "animation": {
          "type": "scale",
          "scale": 1.12,
          "target": "all"
        },
        "slots": [
          {
            "slot": "left",
            "character": "pvzce:purwhite"
          },
          {
            "slot": "right",
            "character": "pvzce:lantina"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "character": "pvzce:purwhite",
        "portrait": "confused",
        "text": "诶？驱散迷雾？",
        "voice": "",
        "side": "left",
        "slots": [
          {
            "slot": "left",
            "character": "pvzce:purwhite"
          },
          {
            "slot": "right",
            "character": "pvzce:lantina"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "character": "pvzce:lantina",
